Citation
--------
Racha, S. et al. MHQA: A Diverse, Knowledge Intensive Mental Health Question
Answering Challenge for Language Models. Preprint at arXiv
https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.15418 (2025).


Question Answering Challenge for Language Models. arXiv:2502.15418.

Files in this directory
-----------------------
  mhqa.json

Modifications
-------------
The data here is not the upstream distribution. It has been modified as follows,
and these changes are the responsibility of the Prj-BENCH authors, not the
upstream authors:

  - Converted to the common Prj-BENCH multiple-choice JSON schema
    (id / question / options / target / kind).
  - Randomly sampled 25 items from each non-factoid category.
  - Quality-control exclusions applied; see ../../_dropped_items.csv.
